[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://uw5xhiffwka6"]

; THROWAWAY. Assignment 6 Step 6 only, and nothing in the game loads it.
;
; It holds ONE GPUParticles2D whose process material is a verbatim copy of
; hit_burst.tscn's PPM_dust -- the same four sub-resources, lifted by script
; rather than retyped. Dust is the emitter the step needs because it is the
; one carrying BOTH a color_ramp and a scale_curve, which is what makes the
; generated shader contain the colour-over-life and scale-over-life sampling.
;
; The first attempt at Step 6 converted a default empty material by mistake,
; and the shader it produced had no sampler2D and no texture() call at all.
; This scene exists so that cannot happen again: there is one node and one
; material, already the right one, with nothing to copy or make unique.

